341 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This recording project was a learning experience\054 we invited Erik Bodin the drummer to studio Klangverket\054 he had not heard the song before and we wanted to record the core band live in the studio\054 after setting up\054 we sat together to play through the song and just 20\05530 mins later\054 the groove was there\054 recording it was quite easy\054 a few takes later we had the foundations\054 I find recording live in the studio like that very rewarding and fun\054 you learn a lot about dynamics and communication\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 348 0 R
     /Pg 337 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

