345 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I met Nikolaj Flor Rotne at a seminar for project managment in Denmark\054 after a few days of classes and workshops\054 we had met many new friends and started exchanging contact infos\056 Nikolaj asked me if he could interview me over a video call for an hour\054 and after that\054 he would write a poem from our conversation\054 send it to me and then his suggestion was that I write a song and melody to the poem\056 A few weeks after the chat\054 Nikolaj sent me the poem and I started reading and letting the words sink in\054 the song arrived and a date was set to meet up to record the song\054 both the music and filming it\054 it was a different kind of experience and we are both happy with the outcome\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 346 0 R
     /Pg 337 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

